{"id": "DfCfDNxSyXD", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Karwa Chauth ka asli naam hai Karak Chaturthi. Karak yaani tonti wala mitti ka ghada, aur isi karwe se is vrat ko naam mila. 🌕\n\nParampara kehti hai, ye vrat sabse pehle Shiv ne Parvati ko bataya tha, ghar ki har vighn baadha door karne ke liye. Aur yugon baad, jab Arjun Neelgiri par tap kar rahe the aur Pandavon par sankat aaye, tab Krishna ne yahi vrat Draupadi ko bataya.\n\nNarad Puran mein bhi is Karak vrat ka zikr hai, aur Nirnay Sindhu, Dharm Sindhu aur Vratraj ise Karak Chaturthi ke naam se hi yaad karte hain.\n\nKarwa Chauth ke din, woh katha jo Krishna ne Draupadi ko sunaai thi: ek behen, saat bhai, aur ek nakli chaand.\n\nAapke ghar mein Karwa Chauth ki kaunsi katha sunaai jaati hai? 👇\n\nSources: Narad Puran (Karak vrat), Nirnay Sindhu, Dharm Sindhu, Vratraj; Krishna-Draupadi aur Shiv-Parvati samvaad vrat katha parampara se.\n\n#karwachauth #karwachauthspecial #mahabharat #krishna #shivparvati", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793195083, "like_count": 14878, "comment_count": 41, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2183246535932894a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 68.329, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPWhFgh6sKuotV09-cqJ7VlzOqPRr7sj8BFfmfyOdIzAIJrC5hYV_iBM4-NvMEuCOTr4HKJIHK9lpzUsj273CLZv2hzkhQndeUUHJ8.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Adqspg2hfB-Qp5pxBgpBACOrD029075qUoIhjL3ICL1Z_Q92sEmXGP7MaLXt6nBUdwecvk32Vb_UswQgP71ClcVT&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.